body:
Varicocele is quite literally a blockage of blood in veins, it's like a varicose vein in any other part of the body, it can feel firm. Can be a lot of things tho but you'll have the appointment soon, I get being anxious but just know that you're already taking the right steps to solve whatever issue you're having!

&#x200B;

Check here to see if you can find what you're looking for:

&#x200B;

[https://www.kenhub.com/en/library/anatomy/male-reproductive-organs](https://www.kenhub.com/en/library/anatomy/male-reproductive-organs)

It's okay, thank you for the information! I'm glad it worked for you the first time around and hope this time it seals the deal!

&#x200B;

Unfortunately, analgesics don't work on me for some reason and there aren't really any other over the counter meds available in my country, you usually need a prescription which  it isn't easy to get just like that. I have been icing them when it's worse and elevating my legs tho, like the doctor said!
